# Camera originals for gallery photos.
#
# Kept on disk so a higher-resolution re-export is possible, but out of git and
# out of the build. They must not live under public/ - Vite copies that folder
# verbatim into dist/, so the thirteen 2K25 originals were adding 57.5 MB of
# unreferenced files to every deploy. The page loads the WebP conversions in
# public/images/gallery instead.
#
# To add more: drop the originals here, then convert with
#   ffmpeg -i in.jpg -vf "scale='min(1600,iw)':-2" -c:v libwebp -quality 82 out.webp
source-images/
